  "notes": "{強力|きょうりょく} emphasizes power and strength.\n\nFORMS:\n- {強力|きょうりょく}な (attributive form)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {強力|きょうりょく}な〜 (powerful ~)\n- {強力|きょうりょく}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{推進|すいしん}する→推進する：17281_suishinsuru⟧ (to promote powerfully)\n\nNOTE ON READING:\n- {強力|きょうりょく} - powerful (na-adjective)\n- ⟦{強力|ごうりき}→強力：noentry⟧ - porter, carrier (different meaning)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {強力|きょうりょく}: powerful (impact, force)\n- ⟦{強|つよ}い→強い：00820_tsuyoi⟧: strong (general)\n- ⟦{有力|ゆうりょく}→有力：13007_yuuryoku⟧: influential, powerful (influence)",
